 "text": "Assessor / Johnson County, Indiana\nPress Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window\nSkip over navigation\nJohnson County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\nMenu\nHome\nGovernment  Commissioners\nADA/Title VI\nCouncil\nAssessor\nAuditor\nRecorder\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nMeeting Center\nDepartments  ADA/Title VI\nAnimal Control\nAnimal Shelter\nConvention - Visitors - Tourism Board\nCounty Coroner\nEmergency Management\nGIS\nHealth\nHighway\nInformation Technology\nJohnson County Employee Site\nJuvenile Detention\nMuseum\nParks\nPlanning & Zoning\nPurdue Extension\nRecycling District\nSenior Services\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nVeterans Affairs\nWeights & Measures\nNineveh Fire District\nJudicial  Bar Association\nCASA\nClerk of the Courts\nCourts  Circuit Court\nJuvenile Court\nSuperior Court 1\nSuperior Court 2\nSuperior Court 3\nSuperior Court 4\nProbation\nSheriff\nVASIA\nElections  Offices Available in 2026\nElection Results\n2026 General Candidate List\n2026 General Vote Center Locations\nHow Do I?  Apply  for a County Attorney ID Card\nOnline for Homestead Deduction\nto be on a Board\nInstructions to Apply Online for Homestead Deduction\nBrowse the County Staff\nPay My Property Taxes\nVacate My Homestead Deduction\nChange my mailing address\nVisit the Meeting Center\nWatch  Past County Meetings\nEmployment Opportunities\nFind  a Document  Agendas\nForms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nUseful Links\nan Event\na Location\na Service\nTitle Search Information\nStart Content\nHome\nGovernment\nAssessor\nAssessor\nThe Two Primary Functions of the County Assessor’s Office:\n1) Assessment of Real and Personal Property\n2) Real Estate & Personal Property Appeals\nThe County Assessor is also responsible for the following:\nOversight of the general reassessment process.\nServes as secretary of the County Property Tax Assessment Board of Appeals.\nEnsures countywide uniform property assessment equalization.\nDiscovers and assesses omitted property.\nVerifies and reviews the self reported values of all personal property in each taxing district.\nCalculates the total assessed value of each taxing district.\nCertifies current assessments to the County Auditor’s Office.\nUtilizes recent sales of land (Sales Disclosures) to establish land rates and values in each neighborhood, adjusts base land values for location, nearness to amenities and other influence factors.\nResearches and selects assessment software and computer systems.\nDetermines and certifies mobile home assessments to the County Auditor.\nRecent News\nServices\nForms\nRecent News\nPTABOA Schedule 2026\nServices\nFind Your Property Assessment Online\nForms\nFarmer's Tangible Personal Property Assessment Form (Form 102)\nBusiness Tangible Personal Property Assessment Form (Form 103 - Long)\nBusiness Tangible Personal Property Short Form (Form 103 - Short)\nBusiness Tangible Personal Property Return (Form 104)\nSchedule of Adjustments (Form 106)\nMore Forms\nContact Us\nMike Watkins ,\nCounty Assessor\nJohnson County Government West Annex\n86 W Court St\nFranklin, IN 46131 Get Directions\nPhone: (317) 346-4701\nFax: (317) 736-7039\nBusiness: (317) 346-4448\nStaff Directory\nHours: Monday through Friday\n8 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nIn this Department\nPTABOA\nJump to a division Make a Selection PTABOA Section Home\nTopics of Interest\nAppeals Property Tax\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Appeals Property Tax Topic Home\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nDocument Center Forms & Applications\nNews & Notices\nServices Index\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Document Center\n- News & Notices\n- Forms & Applications Services Index\nJohnson County, Indiana\n86 W. Court St., Franklin, IN 46131\n(317) 346-4300\n© 2026 Johnson County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\nSite Design and Content Management 